theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 19
text = "You are a hamster in a physics ball. Momentum is your weapon.

WASD       roll / steer
SPACE      hold to charge boost, release to launch
Q / E      dodge left / right
LMB / RMB  fire left / right grapple hook
SHIFT      reel in while hooked
ESC        pause

Build speed with boosts and grapple swings, then slam into enemies. Hard, head-on hits deal the most damage. Beware walls: hit them too fast and your own ball cracks.

Lock-on: charge a boost while the reticle is near an enemy to soft-home into them. The lock commits once you start charging."
autowrap_mode = 3

